Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 09:04:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Follow the Omarchy desktop theme live with [ui] theme =
 "omarchy".

Omarchy renders ~/.config/omarchy/themed/grok.toml.tpl into
~/.local/state/omarchy/current/theme/grok.toml and swaps the theme
directory in atomically on every theme change. With theme = "omarchy"
the pager lays that file's [colors] over Grok Night or Grok Day (per its
`base`) and keeps an inotify watch on current/, so a running session
retints at the moment of the swap, like Ghostty. No hook, signal or poll.

- theme/omarchy.rs: loader, per-field overlay, Watcher (notify -> watch).
- Theme::current() takes the Omarchy palette when one is loaded.
- cache: "omarchy" enables the mode; ThemeStamp = kind + overlay
  generation so entry and markdown render caches re-bake on a new palette.
- event_loop: one select! arm reloads and redraws.

